==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suf|en|tear|ful|pos=adjective}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|en|/ˈtɪɹ.fʊl/}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˈtɪə.fʊl/}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪərfʊl}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Accompanied by [[tear]]s; [[crying]], or about to [[cry]].
#: ''Aaron was a little '''tearful''' until Laura came to reassure him.''
# [[sorrowful|Sorrowful]].
#: {{syn|en|lachrymose}}

